# Keeps the Docker build context small AND, critically, keeps real secrets out
# of image layers: apps/api/.env holds this developer's actual local Supabase/
# JWT values (see apps/api/.env.example for the shape) — without this file,
# `COPY apps/api apps/api` in apps/api/Dockerfile would bake it straight into
# an image layer, recoverable by anyone who later pulls or inspects the image,
# even after a subsequent layer "deletes" it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-standalone
**/dist-designsystem
.git
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
coverage
.DS_Store
